RuleSet: VFSNarrative(mode, role)
* text.status = #generated
* text.div = """
<div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <h2>衛生福利部社會及家庭署脆弱家庭個案管理平台實作指引-{role}</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>實作指引版本：0.0.1</li>
    <li>FHIR版本：4.0.1</li>
    <li>支援格式：<code>json</code>、<code>xml</code></li>
    <li>發布單位：衛生福利部社會及家庭署</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>建議應該（SHOULD）實作的IGs</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="index.html">衛生福利部社會及家庭署脆弱家庭個案管理平台實作指引</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/sfaassn2025-source/base/">臺灣社政領域基礎實作指引（TWSS Base IG）</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>{mode} FHIR RESTful功能要求</h2>
  <div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title">能力聲明摘要</h3></div><div class="panel-body"><p>{role}建議應該（SHOULD）支援本能力聲明所列之 Resource 與 Profile，並以 FHIR R4 RESTful API 交換資料。Resource 的 create、read、vread 與 update 互動建議應該（SHOULD）支援；查詢功能可能可以（MAY）支援。</p></div></div>
  <h3>Resources或Profiles的RESTful功能</h3>
  <h4>Summary</h4>
  <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource名稱</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th>Create</th><th>Read</th><th>VRead</th><th>Delete</th><th>Update</th><th><b>可能可以支援的查詢參數</b></th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><a href="#Bundle-RESTful">Bundle</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-settle-exchange.html">安置案件交換-Bundle VFS</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-from-cra-exchange.html">育兒津貼回饋脆家-Bundle VFS</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-to-cra-exchange.html">脆家傳送育兒津貼-Bundle VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html#search">查看 Bundle 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#EpisodeOfCare-RESTful">EpisodeOfCare</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-EpisodeOfCare-vfs-case.html">脆弱家庭案件-EpisodeOfCare VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html#search">查看 EpisodeOfCare 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#Organization-RESTful">Organization</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Organization-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭主責機構-Organization VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/organization.html#search">查看 Organization 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#Patient-RESTful">Patient</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Patient-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭個案-Patient VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/patient.html#search">查看 Patient 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#Practitioner-RESTful">Practitioner</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Practitioner-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭服務提供者-Practitioner VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitioner.html#search">查看 Practitioner 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#Provenance-RESTful">Provenance</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-Provenance-vfs-search-revocation.html">脆弱家庭撤尋紀錄-Provenance VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/provenance.html#search">查看 Provenance 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#RelatedPerson-RESTful">RelatedPerson</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-RelatedPerson-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭關係人-RelatedPerson VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/relatedperson.html#search">查看 RelatedPerson 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
    <tr><td><a href="#ServiceRequest-RESTful">ServiceRequest</a></td><td>支援的Profiles<br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-ServiceRequest-vfs-case-report.html">脆弱家庭個案通報-ServiceRequest VFS</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-ServiceRequest-vfs-placement.html">脆弱家庭安置案件申請-ServiceRequest VFS</a></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center">y</td><td class="text-center"></td><td class="text-center">y</td><td><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search">查看 ServiceRequest 查詢參數</a></td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>
  <h4 id="Bundle-RESTful">Bundle-RESTful功能</h4><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title">脆弱家庭案件交換</h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>FHIR Resource</strong><br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html">Bundle</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>支援的Profile</strong><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-settle-exchange.html">安置案件交換-Bundle VFS</a><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-from-cra-exchange.html">育兒津貼回饋脆家-Bundle VFS</a><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-Bundle-vfs-to-cra-exchange.html">脆家傳送育兒津貼-Bundle VFS</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>查詢參數</strong><br/>可能可以（MAY）支援FHIR R4 Bundle 所定義之查詢參數。<br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html#search">查看 Bundle 查詢參數</a></div></div></div></div>
  <h4 id="EpisodeOfCare-RESTful">EpisodeOfCare-RESTful功能</h4><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title">脆弱家庭案件</h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>FHIR Resource</strong><br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html">EpisodeOfCare</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>支援的Profile</strong><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-EpisodeOfCare-vfs-case.html">脆弱家庭案件-EpisodeOfCare VFS</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>查詢參數</strong><br/>可能可以（MAY）支援FHIR R4 EpisodeOfCare 所定義之查詢參數。<br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/episodeofcare.html#search">查看 EpisodeOfCare 查詢參數</a></div></div></div></div>
  <h4 id="Organization-RESTful">Organization-RESTful功能</h4><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title">脆弱家庭主責機構</h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>FHIR Resource</strong><br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/organization.html">Organization</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>支援的Profile</strong><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-Organization-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭主責機構-Organization VFS</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>查詢參數</strong><br/>可能可以（MAY）支援FHIR R4 Organization 所定義之查詢參數。<br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/organization.html#search">查看 Organization 查詢參數</a></div></div></div></div>
