  <h4 id="Practitioner-RESTful">Practitioner-RESTful功能</h4><div class="panel panel-default"><div class="panel-heading"><h3 class="panel-title">脆弱家庭服務提供者</h3></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>FHIR Resource</strong><br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitioner.html">Practitioner</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>支援的Profile</strong><br/><a href="StructureDefinition-Practitioner-vfs-case-exchange.html">脆弱家庭服務提供者-Practitioner VFS</a></div><div class="col-lg-4"><strong>查詢參數</strong><br/>可能可以（MAY）支援FHIR R4 Practitioner 所定義之查詢參數。<br/><a href="https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitioner.html#search">查看 Practitioner 查詢參數</a></div></div></div></div>
